id: pm-review-round-exit-contract
title: Round success returns unsupported explicit zero exit code
description: "The existing review round handler returns exit_code zero for complete rounds, but the pinned CLI extension host rejects explicit zero: extension results may specify only failure codes 1 through 255. Direct handler tests do not exercise this host normalization contract. Discovered through the packed respond/status real-data proof; status avoids the gap by omitting the success code."
